1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:09,375
By the stream they find a dead Chinese man, face down, in blue, beside a spade, a heap of stones and a freshly dug hole.

2
00:00:09,375 --> 00:00:11,015
Somebody has been here before.

3
00:00:11,015 --> 00:00:19,986
Evans swears and stamps; Hooker turns white and notices the dead man's neck is puffed and purple, his hands swollen.

4
00:00:19,986 --> 00:00:23,138
Then Hooker looks into the hole: You fool, it's all right.

5
00:00:23,138 --> 00:00:24,348
It's here still.

6
00:00:24,348 --> 00:00:26,158
Dull yellow bars of gold.

